  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Using the action menu to toggle gestures on Index controllers is a mess, it's so much more complicated and requires 6 interactions with the action menu instead of just 2 (pressing a button once for enabling gestures, pressing it again for disabling gestures).\nThe toggle gestures binding action in the SteamVR controller binding settings currently opens/closes the action menu so it's not possible to revert to it this way.\nEdit: Gesture toggle now requires 8 interactions with the action menu, instead of just 2. Has anyone at VRChat ever heard of UI/UX designers and the term \"anti patterns\"?",
